# AMD64 thunk export spec -- faultrep.dll.
#
# From the 2026-08-17 corpus pass.  Styx: Master of Shadows imports this
# module STATICALLY -- one export, ReportFault -- and it had no guest thunk,
# so the loader refused the native ppc64 module (c000007b) and the whole image
# failed to load (c0000135).
#
# No export is emitted, and the report says exactly why for each: eleven are
# SKIPPED because Wine has no implementation to call (they are .spec stubs --
# a thunk into a stub would be a trap that reaches nothing), and three,
# ReportFault among them, are REFUSED because no Wine header declares them.
# Each binds a named sentinel.  The fix this file is for is that the module
# LOADS and the image starts; a crash reporter that is never called because
# the game never crashes is the outcome we want anyway.
DLL faultrep.dll
FROM-SPEC auto
